{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "833131ab696f82be7b91ee1dac91cfdc042bbf0808bacd59e1d38dcc0b2b7447", "ja": "動物達の宴に舞う、花吹雪", "zh": "于动物们的飨宴飞舞，落花纷飞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0eb8832da1d2624ca835eb955e538c5788894e3e9b99590d54fa26340606a61b", "ja": "ついに育とひなたのアイディアが披露され、\nメンバー達のモチベーションは、本番の\nステージに向けて最高潮に。このみは\n本格的なコンセプト決定に取りかかった。", "zh": "育和日向终于表达了自己的想法，\n随着正式演出的时间越来越近，\n所有成员的动力也达到了最高点。\n木实准备要正式敲定表演的主题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "54cf068e0e889e216f4f62d2ca09f0d5d4647911e2f8f6409d8244ee79aeb27a", "ja": "（ミックスナッツライブの\n本番へ向けた準備が、着々と整い始めている）", "zh": "（『Mix Nuts』为了正式演出所做的种种准备，\n终于开始有几分样子了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "31f7168fe902223ac1281cb8e1d28b40d7dc15b01d0ff6f84e4e2ca31ce7e3b5", "ja": "（このみさんによれば、そろそろライブのコンセプトも\nまとまりそうだということだけど……）", "zh": "（听木实说，演唱会的主题\n也差不多要尘埃落定了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "72a48f18766fa347ff38533ef7f03e20e9a3839e4ba23494fd73a6a18cf4dca1", "ja": "今日はライブに来てくれて、ありがとうだにゃ～。\nいっしょうけんめい、がんばるにゃ～。", "zh": "谢谢你们来看今天的演唱会喵～\n人家会努力演出的喵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "9ebe0ff25a2236f0575b398be35d95cba42181125648bf4c0926a3086c8ede68", "ja": "今日はみなさん、どこから来たのパオ～？　遠くからの\n人もご近所さんも、パオーンと盛り上がりましょう！！", "zh": "各位今天是从哪里来的叭～？不论是大老远跑来\n还是住附近的观众，让我们一起叭起来吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c208f734d0336944816acc7a254093692329114ce8025662ec1ea0c47dcf262f", "ja": "……何が始まっているんだ？", "zh": "……这是在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "c3cd16753716e3050c0bf3002ee9092ca2f88594aaf8b94f5d09ea47eebc2da1", "ja": "みんな、今日は私のアダルティな魅力を、\n思う存分、感じていってぴょん♪", "zh": "各位观众，今天可要好好\n感受一下我成熟的魅力蹦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "c94d40538bbfdee02d49f73b17192f7554c61aef5a99e4627645bf1b78482428", "ja": "…………ぴょん♪", "zh": "…………蹦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "af81c206c063a7d24819bbaa7c7167062b5760702584b67219566b3e4b58f2fb", "ja": "あの、なんかみんな、カワイくはあるんだけど……\nいったい何をやっているんだ……？", "zh": "那个，大家是很可爱没错，不过……\n可以请问一下你们到底是在做什么吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "0cf2c2c26e9aa8256b9fd9b5185a23ca96d7b8f2a2642c4ab9c33070082138d0", "ja": "育ちゃんがライブのコンセプトとして、\n『動物いっぱいライブ』を提案してくれたんですパオ♪", "zh": "我们在讨论演唱会的主题时，\n小育提出了『动物大集合演唱会』这个想法叭♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "1b54052f11858994fa490704d6b264f35ac1f4767e913d9e7392389388f73003", "ja": "そうなのよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "没错，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "f568fb9fc395a253cf876493b85a7b3c6a66da41e368a9912964ee5f136f34ac", "ja": "でも現実的に、生きた動物に言うことをきかせるのは\n難しいでしょ？　安全面でのリスクもあるし……。", "zh": "但是就现实层面考量，我们很难让真正的动物听话不是吗？\n此外还有安全方面的风险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "ffe08e3dc7323a4260c6919b4a97431d494780deee5b89036eaf479f8d98bf5f", "ja": "だからね、わたしたちが動物になりきって、おしゃべり\nすることにしたんだよ！　すごいでしょ！？", "zh": "所以呢，大家决定自己扮成动物来说话喔！\n很厉害吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0c29d32db2b7e1343b9b4a6cceec1e9b90cbdb272a39bdea6896a999e0bdc9b4", "ja": "そうか、アイドルによる動物MCか……\nうん、面白いな。いいと思うぞ、育！", "zh": "这样啊，偶像扮成动物进行主持……\n嗯，真是有趣，这点子很棒喔，育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "175e9772204892529f09d73301a0d5d30f2d40021072eeef5e85b9a0dbb3bcf0", "ja": "うわああ！！　な、なんだ、なんの音だ！？\n誰かが劇場を攻撃しているのか！？", "zh": "哇啊！！刚、刚才那是什么声音！？\n是有人在攻击剧场吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ecf24012d3873f773dbafe4a8189de20c45216293b82ea8f170e135cd56bd5fb", "ja": "……と思ったら、大量の紙吹雪が降ってきたぞ！\nどういうことなんだ、これは！？", "zh": "……结果突然飘了一堆纸片下来！\n这到底是怎么回事啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "179d33da46424140212e74266f78910313fc7393ee5da1e7f107ff1af92da1b0", "ja": "兄ちゃ～ん！　驚いたパンダ！？", "zh": "大哥哥～！你有吓到了吗熊猫！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d3c066054d62e2679888ff56e968018d763504d4792a698764e23799e6af04e3", "ja": "真美！？　なんだったんだ、さっきの大量の\n紙ふぶきは！　後で床掃除が大変じゃないか……！", "zh": "真美！？刚才那堆纸片是怎么回事啊！\n待会岂不是要费好一番工夫才能把地板清干净吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "6f449949a5579fc9a4dcb93ddfe48dd1d0f70dae99d35281aabbb4d6a921d78b", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　まあ、落ち着くパンダ、兄ちゃん！\n別に真美、イタズラでバズーカを撃ったんじゃないよ？", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪哎啊，大哥哥，你先冷静点熊猫！\n真美可不是为了恶作剧才发射火箭炮的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "ee592017e3ce564511208bb388921d83a30a19f8dd0bd423ae60d591aef22fb6", "ja": "{$P$}、ごめんワン。\nあたしが考えたコンセプトのせいで驚かせたワン……。", "zh": "{$P$}，对不起汪。\n我想出来的主题吓到你了汪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "656094dc903a2010774b748d0a04a419a6cd9b9ff2ef4613fa7afdeb90befcd4", "ja": "さっきのすごい音と紙吹雪が、\nひなたのアイディアなのか……？", "zh": "刚才的巨响跟从天而降的纸片，\n原来是日向的点子吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "d451ca0c9534a4e0d62a4502d98034229931321b0de1966260594f7f76d4095d", "ja": "あのね、あたしね、会場をお花でいっぱいにする\nライブがしたいって、このみさんに言ったんだワン。", "zh": "那个呀，我跟木实姊说，\n想要办一场用花朵填满整个会场的演唱会汪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "f99d1833bafbedcf104e3f3f584702d836d6b68eb05e5eb66cc4d166c126d9fc", "ja": "見た目もキレイだし、お花のいい香りがしたら\n楽しいから、いい考えだと思ったんだけんど……。", "zh": "那样不仅看起来漂亮，要是还有淡淡花香，\n一定会很好玩，所以我觉得这是个不错的点子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "5839f2a4630df5b7abde17def696d748f36cf50c28088959dc6479c6b22a0492", "ja": "このみんが計算したら、いい香りがする本物の花を\n使うと、お金がいっぱいかかりすぎるパンダ！", "zh": "可是根据木木的计算，如果要使用有花香的真花，\n会花掉好多好多的钱熊猫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "24eb2020aee24c881498e698fd18ef3ad379b71c027e1b8fd58b1c94063d5c28", "ja": "作り物のお花なら安いけど、香りがしないのは\nさびしいワンって真美センセーに相談したら……。", "zh": "用人造花是会比较便宜，但没有花香\n反而让人有点失落汪，跟真美老师谈过以后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "6a17ee107e41a4e7c63e51337c91467d28a0543e189edbc8ea05384d13c20da5", "ja": "ひなぴーのピンチに、真美センセーパンダが立ち上がっ\nたパンダ～。香りもするようにしたっぽいパンダ～！", "zh": "真美老师熊猫来挺身解救小日日了熊猫～\n感觉好像也闻得到香气了熊猫～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "1c3be5a3b3ecaf32cf0455adbee47bee95218bfaa244d411bd005053f3b27303", "ja": "はー、さっきの大きい音は、びっくりした！　けど、\nほんとにいい香りがするね。……あ！　するにゃ～。", "zh": "哎～刚才的声音好大，吓到我了！\n可是，闻起来真的很香呢……啊！是很香喵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "9fc6db7fe1017561b241bd73653cd03a87567cce19656cb8f3934a8d38d670d7", "ja": "わっ、紙吹雪に香りがついてるからだパオっ！\nしかも、この紙吹雪、花の形に切ってある……！", "zh": "哇！因为纸片上面有喷香水叭！\n而且这个纸片，还刻意剪成花的形状……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "abc78a2d5785696a41e3367e886674b0a01f2d703d685a26fe9fb5d1d7e6b0bc", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことか！　ひなたと真美で\n工夫して、アイディアを実現したんだな。", "zh": "我懂了，原来是这么回事啊！\n日向和真美发挥巧思，实现了这个点子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1030_012mam", "source_sha256": "9818fdbceb12106e2ad71eab2a3ad3727e895e87c0d0be72ac3affbceed22814", "ja": "どうどう、兄ちゃん！？　ひなぴーのアイディア、\nすっごいパンダ！　面白いと思うパンダ！？", "zh": "大哥哥，怎么样怎么样！？小日日的点子\n很厉害吧熊猫！你觉得好玩吗熊猫！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "198aee56d5837f14673c7b3eb9bd3df3d538df10c335e52986148922e05199ff", "ja": "確かに、ライブでこれをやったらキレイだし、\nお客さんは驚いて、大盛り上がりしそうだ！", "zh": "的确，在演唱会上撒纸片会很漂亮，\n观众想必会吓一大跳，嗨到最高点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "868889447de3a7fcdd150bb4d1820a47a32446f49bff46af23fe7ad6e2dae2f3", "ja": "えへへ……ほめてもらえて、こちょばいねぇ。\n全部、真美センセーのおかげだよぉ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……被你这样夸奖，人家觉得好不自在呢～\n这些都是真美老师的功劳喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "80c16abbb9c1d218a45ea53a996f732cf6fced1f26ae0e1aa7e1fee079249bd7", "ja": "いや～、ひなぴーもやりますなぁ～。\nこんなの、亜美だって思いつかないかもパンダ！", "zh": "哎呀～小日日也很行呢～\n这种事情，搞不好连亚美都想不到呢熊猫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "9d025e4ed1d1f4da3d6d530897246375b1b05125b0bef77a04d5a30f74ab9b32", "ja": "これからは、紙花吹雪をバズーカにつめれば\n好きな時に劇場でドッカンできるパンダ～！", "zh": "从今以后就能把纸片塞进火箭筒里，\n随心所欲地在剧场里开炮了熊猫～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "7fb08d3b1069678eba0691885d978a6633a774b877bab4e588a2f9dbe53cdabc", "ja": "ついにメンバー全員のコンセプト案が出そろったわね。\nうんうん、おかげで私も、グッと楽になったわ！", "zh": "所有人终于都提出自己对主题的想法了。\n嗯嗯，这样我也能轻松不少了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "6138e26883c5bfc02446620032cf07cd02d69fc9091b052170c388975d44dff0", "ja": "今まで、育ちゃんとひなたちゃんのアイディアの\n空欄をどう埋めるか迷ってたけど、これで解決！", "zh": "我之前一直在烦恼怎么补上小育跟日向空白的想法，\n这下总算解决了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "50d5a7c8a26f287dfc758ff1c88437bb363d30d611e7bc55c24a17babbcbc54e", "ja": "みんなの夢と希望をひとつにまとめる仕事……ふふっ、\nますますやりがいがあるわね！", "zh": "将大家的梦想与希望整合在一起……呵呵，\n这份工作感觉越来越有意义了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "32939d94df580686eb7ad1e18a247193d43f2733a31b448d0b09d4202c0b9a2b", "ja": "張り切ってますね、このみさん。", "zh": "你很有干劲呢，木实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "6745405d6db56cb89193f25b28f5e18185c0088cffbbf5907c6c6e226fa3ba0b", "ja": "ええ、リーダーの面目躍如よ！　見ててね、みんな。\nオトナの本気、ばっちり見せてあげるわ！", "zh": "对啊，队长要大显身手啰！大家看好啰，\n我要让你们瞧瞧大人的厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "14bbdde03a6b1412b198b40ce759698784ffd093cfd47080aa37cfb55ba92363", "ja": "ひなたも育も、よく頑張って考えたな！", "zh": "日向跟育也很努力想出来了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "08a0f73774ea61400c6e46d5c3dc0d8b5d2981885d2fbf8e0adca4d67114c555", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、わたしたちもちゃんとやれたね！", "zh": "日向，我们也成功了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1042_035hin", "source_sha256": "dea2630966ce7ef364d575d652c4a84918205cb0d01ba5e11360357183313848", "ja": "うん、やっと少しは、みんなのお役に立てたみたいで\nよかったわあ。", "zh": "嗯，终于有多少帮到大家的忙，\n太好了哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "9e2b21cc4cc77505600c5f799801aa67b743a119ccae0b9f5f06fa3fd5b3908e", "ja": "（育もひなたも、自主性が出てきた。みんなと協力\nしあえたことが、いい影響を与えているんだろう）", "zh": "（育跟日向都开始变得独立了。应该是\n大家同心协力，给了她们正面的影响吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "27f15656d256ddfb8b6796c4b325b1e4dff5fb28f841d523dcc428d13a9a0b20", "ja": "（いよいよ、ミックスナッツの本領発揮だな！）", "zh": "（『Mix Nuts』终于要发挥本领了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
